    "finalName": "",
    "description": "B'omarr brain jars may be carried by a small <b>Droid Receptacle</b> (typically a modified <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BT-16_Perimeter_Security_Droid\" title=\"BT-16 Perimeter Security Droid\">Arakyd BT-16 Security Droid</a>). While the character's brain jar is carried, they are treated as piloting the <b>Droid Receptacle</b> as a Vehicle with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Total Cover</a>. (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> skill checks and related <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicular_Combat\" title=\"Vehicular Combat\">Vehicular Combat</a> apply and may even perform <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers\" title=\"Starship Maneuvers\">Starship Maneuvers</a>.) Additionally this \"Blindsight\" allows you to ignore <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> (including <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Total_Concealment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Concealment\">Total Concealment</a>) from darkness. However, you cannot perceive colors in total darkness.",
